#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:432
msgid "Privacy mode"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:435
msgid "This plugin runs in Voris Mode A by default: it is cookieless, creates no visitor, session, or user identifier, and needs no cookie banner. Voris resolves the exact privacy mode server-side, per visitor region — the plugin never sets or changes it, and never sends anything mode-specific."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:439
msgid "Mode A is strictly aggregated and cookie-free. Mode B and Mode C add session-based identifiers that Voris derives on its own servers; on those modes, obtaining consent is part of your own legal setup, not something this plugin decides. Your mode is configured in app.voris.ai."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:443
msgid "Consent"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:450
msgid "What Voris receives from this site"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:453
msgid "From the tracking tag: page views and Core Web Vitals (loading-speed measurements). In Mode A these set no cookies and carry no identifier."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:459
msgid "From WooCommerce, for each completed order: the order total, its currency, and the number of items, with the order ID as a reference. Refunds are sent as negative corrections."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:465
msgid "Never sent: customer names, email or postal addresses, or any other personal data; product or line-item details; your visitors&#8217; IP addresses; and no visitor, session, or user identifier."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: the detected consent plugin's name.
#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:485
#, php-format
msgid "%s is active, and the WP Consent API is available. Voris is registered as a consent-aware plugin, so its tracking tag waits for statistics consent before it loads."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:491
msgid "A consent plugin that supports the WP Consent API is active. Voris is registered as consent-aware, so its tracking tag waits for statistics consent before it loads."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: the detected consent plugin's name, 2: the same name again.
#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:497
#, php-format
msgid "We detected %1$s, but it does not use the WP Consent API, so Voris cannot read its consent state automatically. In Mode A no consent is required; for Mode B or C, configure %2$s to cover analytics."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-voris-admin-page.php:503
msgid "No consent-management plugin was detected. In Mode A, Voris is cookieless and needs no consent banner. If your Voris account uses Mode B or C, consent is your responsibility — a plugin that supports the WP Consent API will integrate with Voris automatically."
msgstr ""

